  "Rhythm": "",
  "Deal Curse damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Decrease all foes' DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Ren's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus Defense Down at <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK). Lasts for $5 turns. Ren enters <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link>.\\nAfter boost, additionally increase foes' DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>. Increase the DEF Down debuff to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> (based on Ren's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> bonus DEF Down at <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> ATK). The next [Phantom Gala] will ignore all affinities and decrease target's Down Points by $10.\\nGrant the ally with the highest ATK <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link> (excluding Ren).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Beneath the dazzling dance steps lies a magnificent strike that will steal all of your attention.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Increase all allies' Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> (based on Ren's Crit DMG, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Crit DMG). Lasts for $4 turns. Ren enters <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link>.\\nAfter boost, additionally increase all allies' Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Increase the Crit DMG buff effect to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> (based on Ren's Crit DMG, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> Crit DMG).\\nGrant the ally with the highest ATK <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link> (excluding Ren).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The melody pounds against the heart with the beat. Ready? Let's start, MUSIC!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Use condition: When Ren is in <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link>.\\nInvite all allies to do a <link=\"s|298\"><u>[Coordinated Strike]</u></link>, dealing Almighty damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Almighty <link=\"s|296\"><u>[Coordinated Damage]</u></link> to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. All allies exit <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link>.\\nThis skill can be boosted by spending $4 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link>, up to $3 times. The first boost will increase this damage's base damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> and [Coordinated Damage]'s multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>. The second boost will increase this damage's base damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> and [Coordinated Damage]'s multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The brilliant lights follow my fingertips. Now, at this very moment, let me present you a crazy performance!</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Increase all allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Lasts for $3 turns. Restore $4 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link>.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Curse damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "When {{A}} enters [Phantom Form], increase Ren's ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>, increase other allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Lasts for $3 turns.": "",
  "When {{A}} enters [Phantom Form], increase Ren's ATK by <color=#0169ca>$2</color>. Lasts for $3 turns.": "",
  "After {{A}} uses [Fever Time], increase all allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>, increase [Starlight] characters' DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> instead. Lasts for $3 turns.": "",
  "After {{A}} uses [Fever Time], increase all allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>, increase [Starlight] characters' DMG Dealt by <color=#0169ca>$2</color> instead. Lasts for $3 turns.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Rhapsodic Beat]</color>": "",
  "Combat resource shared by all [Starlight] characters, [Starlight] characters can spend this resource to boost their skills. At the start of [Starlight] characters' turn, restore $2 [Rhapsodic Beat]. Stacks up to $2 times.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Phantom Form]</color>": "",
  "Gain Null Mental/Control Ailment and Null Down. Lasts for $1 turns. {{A}} will exit [Phantom Form] when only he is able to act.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Coordinated Strike]</color>": "",
  "This counts as an {{A}} and counts the activator's {{A}} DMG increase stats. This has base damage and Coordinated damage. This damage cannot deal critical hits, but will convert Crit Rate and Crit DMG into Final DMG Bonus. Increase damage by $2 for each foe that decreases from $1.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>[Coordinated Damage]</color>": "",
  "This damage will calculate using the highest ATK, highest DMG Bonus, highest Crit Rate, and highest Crit DMG from other allies besides the activator.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>{{A}} DMG</color>": "",
  "Independent bonus when dealing {{A}} damage, this effect is calculated independently of other effects.": "",
  "Fever Gala": "",
  "After obtaining {{A}}, allies' {{B}} will deal an additional $1/$2/$3 <link=\"s|294\"><u>Fixed Damage</u></link>, for each of {{A}}'s Awareness level, increase this damage by $4/$5/$6 (effect changes at Lv. 1/50/70, respectively). Increase this Fixed Damage by $8 for each foe that decreases from $7 (takes effect even when {{A}} is not in battle).\\n{{A}} can spend <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link> to boost skill [Phantom Gala].\\n{{A}} has a special skill [Fever Time]: Immediately restore $9 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link>, boost the next [First Movement] or [Syncopated Notes] (cooldown: $10 turn). After using [Fever Time], {{A}} can use other skills.": "",
  "Picaro": "",
  "[Fever Time] additionally restores $1 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link>.\\nAfter using [Fever Time], increase Ren's Crit Rate by $2 and all allies' Crit DMG by $3. Lasts for $4 turns.": "",
  "Restless Starry Night": "",
  "When the party gains $1 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link>, {{A}} will increase all allies' ATK by $2. Stacks up to $3 times.\\nAt the maximum stack, increase {{A}}'s <link=\"s|299\"><u>[{{B}} Damage]</u></link> by $4.": "",
  "Starlight Park": "",
  "Phantom Dance": "",
  "After using HIGHLIGHT, additionally increase all allies' DMG Dealt by $1. Lasts for $2 turns.": "",
  "Free Will in Rhythm": "",
  "Dance of Heart's Desire": "",
  "Boosted [First Movement] additionally increase all allies' Final DMG Amp by $1. Lasts for $2 turns.\\nBoosted [Syncopated Notes] additionally increase all foes' Downed DMG Taken by $3. Lasts for $4 turns.\\nWhen using [Phantom Gala], activate a bonus <link=\"s|298\"><u>[Coordinated Strike]</u></link> at the highest boost state. This [Coordinated Strike] does not spend <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link> and increases Skill Damage by $5.": "",
  "Increase all allies' Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> (based on Ren's Crit DMG, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Crit DMG). Lasts for $4 turns. Ren enters <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link>.\\nAfter boost, additionally increase all allies' Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Increase the Crit DMG buff effect to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> (based on Ren's Crit DMG, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> Crit DMG).\\nGrant the ally with the highest ATK <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link> (excluding Ren).": "",
  "Increase <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies' Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> (based on Ren's Crit DMG, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Crit DMG). Lasts for $4 turns. Ren enters [Phantom Form].\\nAfter boost, additionally increase all allies' Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Increase the Crit DMG buff effect to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> (based on Ren's Crit DMG, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> Crit DMG).\\nGrant the ally with the highest ATK [Phantom Form] (excluding Ren).": "",
  "Deal Curse damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Decrease all foes' DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Ren's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus Defense Down at <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK). Lasts for $5 turns. Ren enters <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link>.\\nAfter boost, additionally increase foes' DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>. Increase the DEF Down debuff to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> (based on Ren's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> bonus DEF Down at <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> ATK). The next [Phantom Gala] will ignore all affinities and decrease target's Down Points by $10.\\nGrant the ally with the highest ATK <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link> (excluding Ren).": "",
  "Deal Curse damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Decrease all foes' DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Ren's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus Defense Down at <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK). Lasts for $5 turns. Ren enters [Phantom Form].\\nAfter boost, additionally increase foes' DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>. Increase the DEF Down debuff to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> (based on Ren's ATK, up to <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> bonus DEF Down at <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> ATK). The next [Phantom Gala] will ignore all affinities and decrease target's Down Points by $10.\\nGrant the ally with the highest ATK [Phantom Form] (excluding Ren).": "",
  "Use condition: When Ren is in <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link>.\\nInvite all allies to do a <link=\"s|298\"><u>[Coordinated Strike]</u></link>, dealing Almighty damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Almighty <link=\"s|296\"><u>[Coordinated Damage]</u></link> to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. All allies exit <link=\"s|295\"><u>[Phantom Form]</u></link>.\\nThis skill can be boosted by spending $4 <link=\"s|297\"><u>[Rhapsodic Beat]</u></link>, up to $3 times. The first boost will increase this damage's base damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> and [Coordinated Damage]'s multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>. The second boost will increase this damage's base damage multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> and [Coordinated Damage]'s multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>.": "",
  "Use condition: When Ren is in [Phantom Form].\\nInvite all allies to do a [Coordinated Strike], dealing Almighty damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK and Almighty [Coordinated Damage] to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK. All allies exit [Phantom Form].\\nThis skill can be boosted by spending $4 [Rhapsodic Beat], up to $3 times. The first boost will increase this damage's multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> and <color=#FFFC40>$6</color>. The second boost will increase this damage's multiplier to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> and <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>.": "",
